    "description": "Mid-term requirements and sample requests for Mugisha Igor (27104). Run requests in order. Saves should return HTTP 201 and their exact success message. Successful reads, updates, and deletes return HTTP 200. Error requests list their expected status and exact message in the request description. Save operations return messages, so the Step 0 GET requests read generated UUIDs into collection variables.",
